content.text:
Now test airborne visuals. Reload, start, tick 5s, jump, hold turn, tick mid-air, screenshot. Use input via eval.

We can make jump and turn then tick small and screenshot at apex:
```js
s.tick(3);
s.input.jumpPressed = true;
s.tick(1/60); // launches
s.input.kbRight = true;
s.tick(0.35);
s.input.kbRight=false;
// screenshot
```
